{
    "note": [
        "One repair, one row, read by both engines that repair a torn tool call.",
        "`repairedBy` names which one owns it, and both suites assert both halves of that:",
        "`worker` means scripts/tool-call-repair.mjs turns `wrote` into `becomes` and",
        "src-tauri/src/tool_repair.rs leaves it alone; `router` is the other way round; `both`",
        "means each engine makes it.",
        "The split is not a preference and is no longer a prose comment either. The agent loop",
        "validates a call against the generated schema between `prepareArguments` and the router,",
        "so a shape the schema refuses never reaches the table and only the worker can answer it,",
        "and a shape it accepts is the router's. `the line between the two engines is the schema's`",
        "in tool-call-repair.test.mjs computes that for every row here with pi-ai's own",
        "`validateToolArguments` \u2014 the function the loop calls \u2014 and refuses a row the worker",
        "repairs that the schema would have let through. Four rows were `both` until it did:",
        "one JavaScript pass reimplementing a repair the router already owned.",
        "Written down and checked by nothing, that line had already drifted once: a fix for the",
        "double-wrapped tag came to exist only in JavaScript while both suites stayed green.",
        "A repair that migrates now fails on the side it left."
    ],
    "repairs": [
        {
            "why": "a key that swallowed its own value, separated by a space",
            "tool": "godot_logs",
            "op": "read",
            "wrote": {
                "limit 50": null
            },
            "becomes": {
                "limit": 50
            },
            "repairedBy": "router"
        },
        {
            "why": "a key that swallowed its own value, concatenated and said twice",
            "tool": "godot_logs",
            "op": "read",
            "wrote": {
                "minSeverityWarning": "warning"
            },
            "becomes": {
                "minSeverity": "warning"
            },
            "repairedBy": "router"
        },
        {
            "why": "a key that swallowed a whole JSON value",
            "tool": "godot_resource",
            "op": "create_shape",
            "wrote": {
                "path": "res://a.tres",
                "shapeType": "RectangleShape2D",
                "size [16, 16]": null
            },
            "becomes": {
                "path": "res://a.tres",
                "shapeType": "RectangleShape2D",
                "size": [16, 16]
            },
            "repairedBy": "router"
        },
        {
            "why": "the same pair torn twice, the second one saying nothing new",
            "tool": "godot_resource",
            "op": "create_shape",
            "wrote": {
                "path": "res://a.tres",
                "shapeType RectangleShape2D": null,
                "size [640, 16]": null
